Former Republican Mayor Ron Wunsch has lived in Circleville all his adult life.

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:09.120
The community basically generated its livelihood off of the industry that came into the community, came in in the 1940s and 1950s.

00:41:09.220 --> 00:41:13.200
